 {:db/id "q-125564" :question/id #uuid "bf0cde7f-5b94-5af7-b3da-c7304b62c190" :question/math-academy-id "q-125564" :question/problem "Find the entry ${b}_{32}$ of the matrix $B$, where \n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The entry ${b}_{32}$ should lie at the intersection of the $3$rd row and $2$nd column. \nSince $B$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix, it does not have the $3$rd row. \n\nTherefore, $B$ does not have the entry ${b}_{32}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-125564/ma-source-field/273cf7083fdb3af84265bd67189d5383423bc2eb222fb7087daaf52378feb4ea"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
